# foldsim_degree.py state --exact: the kinds of --state auto as a 0-1 program
# (foldsim_storage.assign_exact, HiGHS through scipy): the least routing load
# with every pool within its cap, where the repair and polish stop short.
# REQUIRES: scipy
# RUN: %scipy_python %S/Inputs/state/exact.py foldsim | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: exact ['distributed', 'block', 'block'] bram 10.0 load 1231
# CHECK: over ['distributed', 'block', 'block'] load 1231
# CHECK: none None
# CHECK: assign ['distributed', 'block', 'block']
# CHECK: opc: frame 4096 H 4096 fits True routes True moved {{[0-9]+}}
# CHECK: frames: frame 4096 fits True routes True
